OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry and bright with some
OL,6,Fsunny spells, the best of the sunshine
OL,7,Faround the west coast and over the
OL,8,Fislands. Isolated showers possible,
OL,9,Fmainly over the hills. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FDry for most with the cloud
OL,12,Fthinning and breaking at times.
OL,13,FHowever, a little patchy rain could
OL,14,Fpush through Kintyre and parts of the
OL,15,Fwest coast later in the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,18,Fwith hazy sunshine at times. A few
OL,19,Fshowery bursts of rain possible
OL,20,Fthrough Ayrshire, Arran and the
OL,21,FHebrides.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
